<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 12:37:53 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>医疗保健领域的人工智能红利是实实在在的。现在的重点是扩大其影响</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/11/ai-dividend-healthcare-extend-impact-philips-index/</link><description>在卫生系统压力的推动下，人工智能正在从承诺走向实践。它开始带来红利。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/jeff_dilullo_img01-AAA-global.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 12:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/11/ai-dividend-healthcare-extend-impact-philips-index/</guid></item><item><title>OpenAI 首席财务官坚称人工智能不会取代判断力</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/11/openai-cfo-insists-ai-wont-replace-judgment/</link><description>Sarah Friar 提出了建立人工智能原生财务团队的五个步骤，从访问权到问责制。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-1236615026.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 11:34:29 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/11/openai-cfo-insists-ai-wont-replace-judgment/</guid></item><item><title>苹果股价下跌，新任首席执行官 John Ternus 将推出高端“全玻璃”iPhone 的希望破灭</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/11/apple-stock-aapl-ceo-john-ternus-all-glass-iphone/</link><description>今天早上到达办公室之前您需要了解的所有信息。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2287932656.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 10:10:16 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/11/apple-stock-aapl-ceo-john-ternus-all-glass-iphone/</guid></item><item><title>军情六处前局长表示，首席执行官面临的最大风险是他们已经了解的威胁</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/11/ex-mi6-chief-richard-moore-biggest-risks-for-ceos/</link><description>另外：《财富》杂志上的所有新闻和闲聊。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Sixth-Street_Austin_Sir-Richard-Moore_0205_FINAL.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 09:55:30 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/11/ex-mi6-chief-richard-moore-biggest-risks-for-ceos/</guid></item><item><title>国会预算办公室 (CBO) 表示，美国财政部每天支付 30 亿美元的国债利息，此前已花费 100 亿美元支撑其最大贷款机构的货币</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/11/us-treasury-national-debt-interest-cbo-yen-unwinds/</link><description>美国国会预算办公室报告称，2025 年 10 月（财年开始时）至 2026 年 7 月期间公共债务净利息总额为 9,630 亿美元。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2250795081-e1786444555333.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 10:49:18 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/11/us-treasury-national-debt-interest-cbo-yen-unwinds/</guid></item><item><title>截至 2026 年 8 月 11 日的当前油价</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/price-of-oil-08-11-2026/</link><description>当油价变化时，它会影响您的能源成本，甚至日常用品的价格。原因如下。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Price-of-Oil-August-11.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 10:20:36 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/price-of-oil-08-11-2026/</guid></item><item><title>扎克·戴尔的目标是通过 Base Power 为自己赢得声誉</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/11/zach-dell-aims-to-build-a-name-for-himself-with-base-power/</link><description>本月满 30 岁的扎克·戴尔 (Zach Dell) 创立了一家家用电池和科技公司，并成功筹集了 130 亿美元的估值。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Image_Headshot_CEO_Zach_Dell-e1761603594253.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 10:11:05 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/11/zach-dell-aims-to-build-a-name-for-himself-with-base-power/</guid></item><item><title>惠普生命中的一年：UK&amp;amp;I MD 如何平衡完美与速度，并以人为本</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/11/year-in-the-life-hp-uki-md-balancing-perfection-speed-putting-people-first/</link><description>在过去的几个月里，《财富》杂志与惠普高级领导进行了交谈，以了解该公司如何发展——从创新和文化到客户参与和未来工作。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-987512596-e1786440111798.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 09:30:18 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/11/year-in-the-life-hp-uki-md-balancing-perfection-speed-putting-people-first/</guid></item><item><title>十年来加州社交媒体明星秃头鹰杰基的去世让粉丝们“心碎”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/11/jackie-bald-eagle-death-california/</link><description>非营利组织大熊谷之友于 2015 年安装了巢穴摄像头，记录了每个繁殖季节的成功和失败。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AP26222788532630.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 09:24:42 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/11/jackie-bald-eagle-death-california/</guid></item><item><title>来认识一下这位 37 岁的单亲母亲和前一线厨师，她在威斯康星州激怒了民主党温和派</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/11/francesca-hong-dsa-wisconsin-governor-candidate-single-mother/</link><description>Francesca Hong 呼吁免费儿童保育和医疗保健，并暂停数据中心建设。她曾经想取消对警察的资助。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AP26206127843778-e1786440072424.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 09:21:34 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/11/francesca-hong-dsa-wisconsin-governor-candidate-single-mother/</guid></item></channel></rss>